PROBLEM: Summarise the following 60-word paragraph in exactly 25 words: "At 4:30 a.m., Khetaram woke to the muezzin's call. He ate bajra roti with chilli pickle, packed his canvas bag with 47 letters, 12 money orders, and 3 pension forms. His camel, Bijli, was already saddled. The sandstorm last night had buried the track to Rampura, so he took the longer dune route."

STEPS:
- Step 1: Identify the five Ws — Who: Khetaram; When: 4:30 a.m.; What: mail delivery; Where: desert track to Rampura;

